objects.\nOnce the battle simulation starts, it will be a gesture operation.\n1.Attack - Either hand is a Paper\nFrom the palm of your hand, the spell of Shikigami comes out.\nPlease hit enemies and items.\n2.Defense - Either hand is a Rock\nA shield will appear to prevent enemy attacks.\nIf an enemy attack approaches, use a shield to prevent it.\n\nAs the scenario progresses, you can use a Bomb Attack.\n\n(Please refer to the website for a description of the items in the game.)\n\n\u2022 How to proceed with the game\n1.Start\nOnce booted, system navigation will begin.\nTouch the Start-device to start.\n2.GamePlay\nIf you select Shikigami, the battle simulation will start after a while.\n3.GameOver\nThe game is over when you receive a lot of damage and the \"sustainability\" reaches \"0\".", "short_description": "Pass-through MR shooting game.\nWelcome to Simulation X.\nPlease experience the power of Shikigami with MR."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "SX_HA2.png", "id": "3000425346762311", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974640_3000425350095644_345006402581541278_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7S-LggcOYlUQ7kNvwHl9i_r&_nc_oc=Adm-0Cq9_wFfntr4Dqbnj23Z9CDXYH7a3pGhw7-z35X2cwrFvn2mTqIh-7YrN6zwqbg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu1lKPNEJ6tmyf7PRh_8zVOM910jzlUNV6SWh1T4K0SwA&oe=69A04438"}, {"file_name": "SX_CA_T.png", "id": "2224180891334863", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974746_2224180894668196_895140125717342456_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O_j2-qqi-isQ7kNvwE-ljvZ&_nc_oc=Adny4qzkWZ4yxwBMlb3AqRP3tlgAXRB-4yN8-hnniY1IpsptJE_97uOOV7snmpG1vvg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv_OAEHN-T4YMaJ2Sy5R6Fhzk3OSULWHle4YMxUfpPJyw&oe=69A05606"}, {"file_name": "SX_CA_Y.png", "id": "1340026530594820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.o